      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-770--c32d4c9273200deb3a433f921d015b2c27d02e925e2b9bb93faf83d862837fb6.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-771",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "送防秋将",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "张籍",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "白首征西将，犹能射戟支。\n元戎选部曲，军吏换旌旗。\n逐虏招降远，开边旧垒移。\n重收陇外地，应似汉家时。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "76a5727d6ad4293ba7ab6ec0a8aa3fe677cc4b7ec97fd5e9b05ef27295fb3345",
